      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't think there is a \"long term.\" the world just keeps spinning and people just keep being corrupt. i've realized that no matter what i do, the \"reward\" for being a good person is just being alone and miserable. i'm just so tired of fighting a losing battle. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the exhaustion is to just... stop. to just let it all go. does it ever actually get better, or are we all just pretending?",
